Standards-Version: 4.19.2
Homepage: https://github.com/debajyotid4s/ClipConnect---clipboard-android-linux-CLI-tool

Package: clipconnect
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${deps}, wl-clipboard | (xclip | xsel)
Description: CLI-based automated clipboard sync between Android and Linux
 ClipConnect syncs the clipboard bidirectionally between an Android phone
 and a Linux laptop on the same LAN, automatically and end-to-end
 encrypted. Copy text on either device and it appears on the other within
 a couple of seconds. Pair once with a QR code; everything after that is
 automatic. The daemon runs as the normal user under a systemd user unit.
